OL,3,GNEWSAIsland's new airport departure
OL,4,Alounge to open soon
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Airport's newly refurbished #10m
OL,7,Fdeparture lounge will finally be seen
OL,8,Fby members of the public "as early as
OL,9,Fnext week", Ports of Jersey's chief
OL,10,Fexecutive has said.
OL,12,FThe hall includes a viewing platform,
OL,13,Fwicker cows, Jersey granite and signage
OL,14,Fin the island's native language
OL,15,FJerriais.
OL,17,FMatt Thomas said the re-design had been
OL,18,Fpaid for solely with revenues generated
OL,19,Fby the island's ports.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
